        "note": "Why this is recorded per example rather than assumed: the mechanism exists so an example may carry terms this project could not adopt. Here the terms are none, because the figures were transcribed from an 1855 publication rather than from HistData (GPL) or causaldata (MIT). One file is an exception and is named in the licence field: the sub-district polygons are redistributed under BSD-2-Clause, which asks for attribution and does not restrict who may receive a map derived from them. That is why this example can carry them where the UK Data Service's sub-district shapefile, whose licence reaches derived datasets, could not be carried by anyone."
      },
